# Side B level 1 (NATHAN_SIDE_B=1), for `scripts/record-run --capture`: Han walks it alone,
# the player only calls the band from the set list (Left/Right picks, Down calls).

# Try 1: fired up at the giant wall (wrong call), then Giant Steps over it, and nothing left
# for the long gap: Han gives up, the level rewinds.
wait 3
tap Right
wait 200ms
tap Down
wait 3
tap Left
wait 200ms
tap Down
wait 27

# Try 2: Giant Steps at the wall, fired up at the gap (it takes over from Giant Steps).
wait 3
tap Down
wait 4
tap Right
wait 200ms
tap Down
wait 8
